        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiruruchi koik che bo kabwatet",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagolanda bororiet tugul eng’ Jordan, kong’alalji Jehovah Josua kolenji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olewen anyun murenik taman ak aeng’ eng’ bik, chito agenge eng’ oret age tugul ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ong’at ichek olenji, Okwei koik taman ak aeng’ eng’ kwenutab Jordan, ole katononie kelyekab tisiik, ak oib onde ng’ony eng’ ole omuung’e, ole oruitosi kemouni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koguur anyun Josua bichoto taman ak aeng’, che kiga kochob eng’ lagokab Israel chito agenge eng’ oret age tugul: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kolenji Josua, Oba ondoe moingetab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, kot oit kwenutab Jordan, ak koib chi age tugul eng’ okwek koita eng’ tigikyennyi, che te koitetab ortinwekab lagokab Israel: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si kobiit koek nito kaborunet eng’ kwenung’wong’, si ye tun teebenak lagokwok eng’ betusiek che bwanei kole, Iboru nee koichu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenji anyun, Amu kipcheigei beekab Jordan eng’ taitab moingetab arorutiet ne bo Jehovah: ye kilong’une moingonoto Jordan, kotononso beekab Jordan kototen: koek koichu anyun kabwatet eng’ lagokab Israel koigeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai lagokab Israel ko u ye king’at Josua, ak kokwei koik taman ak aeng’ eng’ kwenutab Jordan, ko u che kimwachi Jehovah Josua, che te koitetab ortinwekab lagokab Israel; ak kiib kot koit ole kiba koruiyo, ak konde ng’ony eng’ oloto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiruruch Josua koichato taman ak aeng’ eng’ kwenutab Jordan, eng’ ole kitonone kalyekab tisiik che kiibei moingetab arorutiet: ak mi oloto, agoi kora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kitonone kwenutab Jordan tisiik che kiibei moinget, agoi kobata tuguk tugul che king’at Jehovah Josua komwachi bik, ko u tugul che king’at Musa Josua: ak kiigirgir bik kolanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagolanda bik tugul kogestagei, kolanda moingetab Jehovah anyun, koboto tisiik, kogeerei bik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kilanda lagokab Reuben ak lagokab Gad, ak kebebertab oretab Manase, kolaachi karik, kondoe lagokab Israel, ko u ye kimwachi Musa ichek: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki olo bo elfusiek artam bik che kilanda eng’ taitab Jehovah, che kilaachi karik che kiga kochobok agobo luget, agoi warengetab Jeriko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiitoror Jehovah Josua eng’ betunoto eng’ taitab Israel tugul; ak kiiywei inendet, ko u ye kiiywei Musa, eng’ betusiek tugul che bo sobennyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji Jehovah Josua kolenji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’at tisiik che ibei moingetab baornatet, kotogos eng’ Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kong’at anyun Josua tisiik kolenji, Otogosu eng’ Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingotogos tisiik che kiibei moingetab arorutietab Jehovah eng’ Jordan, ak ye kingotiech tisiik emet ne yaamat, kowekyigei beekab Jordan komostanywa, ak kosiir ngegusiekyik tugul ko u eng’ tai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitogos bik eng’ Jordan eng’ betutab taman ne bo arawetab tai, ak kiteech emaisiek eng’ Gilgal, ole bo kiwotetab Jeriko ne tokyingei kong’asis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiruruch Josua koichato taman ak aeng’ eng’ Gilgal, choto che kiibune Jordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’alalji lagokab Israel kolenji, Ye tun teebe lagokwok kwanisiekwak eng’ betusiek che bwanei, kolenji, Iboru nee koichu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oborji anyun lagokwok konai, olenji, Kilong’une Israel Jordanini ko kagoyaam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kiyai Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’ Nyanjet ne Birir, ne kiyai koyaam eng’ tainnyo, agoi kelong’u: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "si kobiit konai bik tugul che bo ng’ony eutab Jehovah, kole kim; si kobiit koiywei Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’ koigeny.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.4.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
